Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the Pixel tile editor with one in the control centre style: a
dark sheet showing the panel tiles laid out exactly like the control
centre (six icon keys, then large keys), the offer of other tiles below
and the panel blocks. Tap removes (-) or adds (+) a tile, a long press
picks a key up to move it, drop it into the panel or out of it; the name
of the key under the finger is shown in the hint line. Tiles are stored
as before (sysui_qs_tiles); the order and visibility of the media, tiles
and brightness blocks go to Settings.Secure budik_cc_blocks, which the
control centre follows.
